# Git author for this repo

Never run `git config`. For every `git commit` in this repo, set environment variables for that command only:

- `GIT_AUTHOR_NAME=parik6144`
- `GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL=15952747+parik6144@users.noreply.github.com`
- `GIT_COMMITTER_NAME=parik6144`
- `GIT_COMMITTER_EMAIL=15952747+parik6144@users.noreply.github.com`

Vercel Hobby + private GitHub does not deploy commits from other authors (for example Amit Parik).
